        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana S45BBU, 4-1/2\" x 4-1/2\" x Square Corners Heavy Duty Steel Hinge with 2 Ball Bearings</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackage includes a pair of hinges (2) with matching finish steel flathead, Phillips Drive #12 x 1-1/4\" wood screws and #12-24 x 1/2\" machine screws. Available in 9 different finish colors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFitted with a high grade, removable, steel pin. Utilizes template screw hole pattern for use with wood or metal doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-S45BBU-specifications.gif?v=1704354659\" width=\"552\" height=\"248\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana S45BBU Hinge Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 4-1/2 Inch HD Steel Hinges:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Height: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: Square</li>\r\n<li>Dual Ball-Bearings: 2 BB\r\n<li>Thickness: 0.134\" (Heavy Duty)</li>\r\n<li>Standard Template Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Pin: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #12 x 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Machine Screws: #12-24 x 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-S45BBU-specifications.pdf?v=1704262169\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana S45BBU Hinge Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold in Pairs (2 Hinges)</b>\r\n</p>",
