                "title": "4-1/2 x 4-1/2 x Square Corners Heavy Duty Steel Hinge with Ball Bearing",
                "description": "Deltana S45BBUx- 4-1/2x 4-1/2 Steel Hinges, Heavy Duty 2 Ball Bearings with square corners, 0.134 thick. Package includes a pair of hinges, matching Steel flathead, Phillips screws. Available in 9 different finish colors.",
